== Fun Facts
- The pronunciation of my first name is unique, the second “g” is silent, e.g, Guangyi (广义).

== Misc
- I'm a tennis enthusiast and play a lot during my free time. Feel free to let me know if you want to hit! 

- I love all kinds of semi-trucks, and enjoy playing American Truck Simulator (ATS) a lot!